cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
message: "If you use this construction or implementation, please cite this repository."
title: "A two-involution construction of wing bijections"
version: "0.1.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Jain"
    given-names: "Hardik"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hxrdxkxvxd/wing-bijection"
url: "https://github.com/hxrdxkxvxd/wing-bijection"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  A determinant-free construction of wing bijections on finite subsets of the
  Boolean cube, with Lean-checked termination and correctness and a whole-cube
  Butterfly Lemma corollary. The repository includes an executable implementation
  and the accompanying manuscript.
keywords:
  - combinatorics
  - Boolean cube
  - involutions
  - wing bijections
  - formal verification
  - Lean
